          "solution": "```python\nimport numpy as np\n\ndef pca_svd_and_zca(X, k: int, eps: float = 1e-5) -> tuple[float, float, float]:\n    X = np.asarray(X, dtype=float)\n    n, d = X.shape\n    Xc = X - X.mean(axis=0, keepdims=True)\n    _, s, Vt = np.linalg.svd(Xc, full_matrices=False)\n    eigvals = (s ** 2) / (n - 1)\n    evr_k = float(np.sum(eigvals[:k]) / np.sum(eigvals))\n    Xc_hat = (Xc @ Vt[:k].T) @ Vt[:k]\n    recon_mse = float(np.sum((Xc - Xc_hat) ** 2) / n)\n    inv_sqrt = 1.0 / np.sqrt(eigvals + eps)\n    Z_zca = ((Xc @ Vt.T) * inv_sqrt[None, :]) @ Vt\n    diag_corrs = [abs(float(np.corrcoef(Xc[:, j], Z_zca[:, j])[0, 1])) for j in range(d)]\n    return (round(evr_k, 4), round(recon_mse, 4), round(float(np.mean(diag_corrs)), 4))\n```"
