          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom scipy import sparse\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(1921)\n\ndef randomized_svd_halko(A, k: int, p: int = 8, q: int = 2, seed: int = 42):\n    \"\"\"\n    Halko, Martinsson & Tropp (2011) Randomized SVD dengan QR-stabilized Power Iterations.\n    Bekerja langsung pada matriks dense NumPy maupun scipy.sparse CSR tanpa densifikasi!\n    \"\"\"\n    r = np.random.default_rng(seed)\n    n_rows, n_cols = A.shape\n    l = min(k + p, min(n_rows, n_cols))\n\n    # Stage A: Randomized Range Finder (Ortonormal Q mendekati kolom-ruang A)\n    Omega = r.standard_normal(size=(n_cols, l))\n    Y = A @ Omega\n    Q, _ = np.linalg.qr(Y, mode=\"reduced\")\n\n    # Subspace Power Iterations (q kali) dengan re-ortogonalisasi QR agar bebas round-off loss\n    for _ in range(q):\n        Z = A.T @ Q\n        Qz, _ = np.linalg.qr(Z, mode=\"reduced\")\n        Y = A @ Qz\n        Q, _ = np.linalg.qr(Y, mode=\"reduced\")\n\n    # Stage B: Exact SVD pada matriks kecil B = Q^T A berdimensi (l x d)\n    B = Q.T @ A\n    if sparse.issparse(B):\n        B = B.toarray()\n    U_tilde, s_all, Vt_all = np.linalg.svd(B, full_matrices=False)\n    U_k = Q @ U_tilde[:, :k]\n    return U_k, s_all[:k], Vt_all[:k, :]\n\n# Uji pada dua rezim spektrum: (1) Fast Decay vs (2) Slow Heavy-Tailed Decay (khas TF-IDF)\nn, d, k = 320, 220, 10\nU_rand, _ = np.linalg.qr(rng.standard_normal((n, d)), mode=\"reduced\")\nV_rand, _ = np.linalg.qr(rng.standard_normal((d, d)), mode=\"reduced\")\n\nsv_fast = 20.0 * (0.76 ** np.arange(d))\nsv_slow = 20.0 / ((np.arange(1, d + 1)) ** 0.72)\n\nfor regime, sv_true in [\n    (\"Fast Spectral Decay (sigma_j ~ 0.76^j)\", sv_fast),\n    (\"Slow Heavy-Tailed Decay (sigma_j ~ j^-0.72, khas teks)\", sv_slow),\n]:\n    A = (U_rand * sv_true[None, :]) @ V_rand.T\n    # Galat terbaik teoritis (Eckart-Young-Mirsky) untuk rank k\n    opt_frob_err = float(np.sqrt(np.sum(sv_true[k:] ** 2)))\n    print(f\"\\n=== {regime} (n={n}, d={d}, k={k}, p=8) ===\")\n    print(\"Power Iter q | Opt Err (EYM) | rSVD Frob Err | Kelebihan Galat (%) | RelErr sigma_10\")\n    print(\"-\" * 86)\n    for q in [0, 1, 2, 3]:\n        Uk, sk, Vtk = randomized_svd_halko(A, k=k, p=8, q=q, seed=42)\n        rsvd_err = float(np.linalg.norm(A - (Uk * sk[None, :]) @ Vtk, \"fro\"))\n        excess_pct = 100.0 * (rsvd_err - opt_frob_err) / opt_frob_err\n        sv10_err = abs(sk[-1] - sv_true[k - 1]) / sv_true[k - 1]\n        print(f\"    q = {q:1d}    | {opt_frob_err:13.5f} | {rsvd_err:13.5f} | {excess_pct:18.4f}% | {sv10_err:14.2e}\")\n\n# Verifikasi operasi langsung pada scipy.sparse.csr_matrix (tanpa pernah menyentuh .toarray() pada A!)\nA_sp = sparse.random(400, 600, density=0.025, format=\"csr\", random_state=42)\nUs, ss, Vts = randomized_svd_halko(A_sp, k=5, p=8, q=2, seed=42)\n_, s_exact_sp, _ = np.linalg.svd(A_sp.toarray(), full_matrices=False)\nprint(\"\\n=== Verifikasi Sparse CSR Langsung (400x600, density=2.5%) ===\")\nprint(f\"Top-5 SV Exact : {[round(float(x), 4) for x in s_exact_sp[:5]]}\")\nprint(f\"Top-5 SV rSVD  : {[round(float(x), 4) for x in ss]}\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== Fast Spectral Decay (sigma_j ~ 0.76^j) (n=320, d=220, k=10, p=8) ===\nPower Iter q | Opt Err (EYM) | rSVD Frob Err | Kelebihan Galat (%) | RelErr sigma_10\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n    q = 0    |       1.97835 |       2.10198 |             6.2492% |       4.51e-03\n    q = 1    |       1.97835 |       1.97836 |             0.0001% |       1.15e-06\n    q = 2    |       1.97835 |       1.97835 |             0.0000% |       1.19e-10\n    q = 3    |       1.97835 |       1.97835 |             0.0000% |       8.40e-15\n\n=== Slow Heavy-Tailed Decay (sigma_j ~ j^-0.72, khas teks) (n=320, d=220, k=10, p=8) ===\nPower Iter q | Opt Err (EYM) | rSVD Frob Err | Kelebihan Galat (%) | RelErr sigma_10\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n    q = 0    |      15.43881 |      18.69372 |            21.0827% |       2.51e-01\n    q = 1    |      15.43881 |      15.52223 |             0.5403% |       1.64e-02\n    q = 2    |      15.43881 |      15.44508 |             0.0407% |       2.92e-03\n    q = 3    |      15.43881 |      15.43969 |             0.0057% |       6.53e-04\n\n=== Verifikasi Sparse CSR Langsung (400x600, density=2.5%) ===\nTop-5 SV Exact : [6.8107, 4.2956, 4.2183, 4.1689, 4.1453]\nTop-5 SV rSVD  : [6.7877, 4.0502, 3.9755, 3.8806, 3.8299]",
          "actualOutput": "=== Fast Spectral Decay (sigma_j ~ 0.76^j) (n=320, d=220, k=10, p=8) ===\nPower Iter q | Opt Err (EYM) | rSVD Frob Err | Kelebihan Galat (%) | RelErr sigma_10\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n    q = 0    |       1.97835 |       2.10198 |             6.2492% |       4.51e-03\n    q = 1    |       1.97835 |       1.97836 |             0.0001% |       1.15e-06\n    q = 2    |       1.97835 |       1.97835 |             0.0000% |       1.19e-10\n    q = 3    |       1.97835 |       1.97835 |             0.0000% |       8.40e-15\n\n=== Slow Heavy-Tailed Decay (sigma_j ~ j^-0.72, khas teks) (n=320, d=220, k=10, p=8) ===\nPower Iter q | Opt Err (EYM) | rSVD Frob Err | Kelebihan Galat (%) | RelErr sigma_10\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n    q = 0    |      15.43881 |      18.69372 |            21.0827% |       2.51e-01\n    q = 1    |      15.43881 |      15.52223 |             0.5403% |       1.64e-02\n    q = 2    |      15.43881 |      15.44508 |             0.0407% |       2.92e-03\n    q = 3    |      15.43881 |      15.43969 |             0.0057% |       6.53e-04\n\n=== Verifikasi Sparse CSR Langsung (400x600, density=2.5%) ===\nTop-5 SV Exact : [6.8107, 4.2956, 4.2183, 4.1689, 4.1453]\nTop-5 SV rSVD  : [6.7877, 4.0502, 3.9755, 3.8806, 3.8299]",
          "explanation": "Membangun Randomized SVD Halko-Martinsson-Tropp lengkap dengan QR-stabilized power iterations yang mendukung matriks dense maupun CSR sparse, lalu membuktikan penurunan eksponensial galat aproksimasi saat q naik dari 0 ke 3 pada spektrum slow-decay.",
