          "id": "code-ml-19-2-ch19_2_diag",
          "title": "Production Audit: Sensitivitas n_iter pada Heavy-Tailed Spectrum, Offset Trap & Stream Drift",
          "language": "python",
          "filename": "19_2_power_iter_offset_stream_audit.py",
          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom scipy import sparse\nfrom sklearn.decomposition import IncrementalPCA, PCA, TruncatedSVD\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(1923)\n\n# 1) Audit Sensitivitas n_iter (Power Iterations) pada TruncatedSVD Matriks Heavy-Tailed\nn, d, k = 450, 350, 8\nU_q, _ = np.linalg.qr(rng.standard_normal((n, d)), mode=\"reduced\")\nV_q, _ = np.linalg.qr(rng.standard_normal((d, d)), mode=\"reduced\")\n# Spektrum berekor panjang: rasio sigma_9 / sigma_8 ~ 0.94 (sangat sulit tanpa power iter!)\nsv_heavy = 15.0 / ((np.arange(1, d + 1)) ** 0.55)\nX_heavy = (U_q * sv_heavy[None, :]) @ V_q.T\n\nexact_svd = TruncatedSVD(n_components=k, algorithm=\"arpack\", random_state=42).fit(X_heavy)\nV_exact = exact_svd.components_\n\nprint(\"=== 1. Audit n_iter pada TruncatedSVD (Spektrum Heavy-Tailed, sigma_9/sigma_8=0.94) ===\")\nprint(\"n_iter | Subspace Overlap | Max RelErr SV | Status Rekomendasi\")\nprint(\"-\" * 68)\nfor n_it in [0, 1, 2, 4, 7]:\n    m = TruncatedSVD(n_components=k, algorithm=\"randomized\", n_iter=n_it, n_oversamples=10, random_state=42).fit(X_heavy)\n    overlap = float(np.linalg.norm(V_exact @ m.components_.T, \"fro\") ** 2 / k)\n    rel_err = float(np.max(np.abs(m.singular_values_ - exact_svd.singular_values_) / exact_svd.singular_values_))\n    tag = \"BURUK (basis meleset)\" if overlap < 0.85 else (\"CUKUP\" if overlap < 0.97 else \"SIAP PRODUKSI\")\n    print(f\"  {n_it:2d}   | {overlap:16.5f} | {rel_err:13.5f} | {tag}\")\n\n# 2) Audit Efek Uncentered TruncatedSVD Saat Ada Offset Rata-Rata Global\n#    Pada matriks positif non-normalized, SV1 TruncatedSVD menyedot vektor rata-rata global!\nZ_sig = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(400, 2))\nW_sig = np.array([[1.2, 0.0], [1.1, 0.2], [0.0, 1.3], [0.1, 1.2], [0.8, -0.9]])\nX_shift = 8.0 + Z_sig @ W_sig.T + rng.normal(0.0, 0.2, size=(400, 5))\n\ntsvd_raw = TruncatedSVD(n_components=2, random_state=42).fit(X_shift)\npca_cen = PCA(n_components=2).fit(X_shift)\nones_unit = np.ones(5) / np.sqrt(5.0)\nalign_ones_tsvd = abs(float(np.dot(tsvd_raw.components_[0], ones_unit)))\nalign_ones_pca = abs(float(np.dot(pca_cen.components_[0], ones_unit)))\n\nprint(\"\\n=== 2. Jebakan Uncentered TruncatedSVD pada Data Ber-Offset Rata-Rata (+8.0) ===\")\nprint(f\"|cos(v1_TruncatedSVD, vektor_rata2_global)| = {align_ones_tsvd:.4f}  <-- PC1 tercuri oleh offset rata-rata!\")\nprint(f\"|cos(v1_PCA_Centered, vektor_rata2_global)| = {align_ones_pca:.4f}  <-- PC1 fokus ke varians sinyal sejati\")\n\n# 3) Audit Pitfall IncrementalPCA: Stream Teracak (i.i.d.) vs Stream Terurut Non-Stasioner\n#    6 segmen produk ortogonal muncul berurutan tanpa shuffle (khas log kronologis!)\nsegs = []\nfor s_idx in range(6):\n    W_seg = np.zeros((24, 2))\n    W_seg[s_idx * 4 : (s_idx + 1) * 4, :] = rng.normal(0.0, 1.5, size=(4, 2))\n    segs.append(rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(160, 2)) @ W_seg.T + rng.normal(0.0, 0.3, size=(160, 24)))\nX_ordered = np.vstack(segs)\nX_shuffled = X_ordered[rng.permutation(len(X_ordered))]\n\npca_ref = PCA(n_components=6).fit(X_ordered)\nipca_ord = IncrementalPCA(n_components=6, batch_size=24).fit(X_ordered)\nipca_shf = IncrementalPCA(n_components=6, batch_size=24).fit(X_shuffled)\n\nmse_ref = float(np.mean((X_ordered - pca_ref.inverse_transform(pca_ref.transform(X_ordered))) ** 2))\nmse_ord = float(np.mean((X_ordered - ipca_ord.inverse_transform(ipca_ord.transform(X_ordered))) ** 2))\nmse_shf = float(np.mean((X_ordered - ipca_shf.inverse_transform(ipca_shf.transform(X_ordered))) ** 2))\n\nprint(\"\\n=== 3. Pitfall IncrementalPCA (batch_size=24): Ordered Stream vs Shuffled Stream ===\")\nprint(f\"Full PCA Reference             | Recon MSE = {mse_ref:.5f}\")\nprint(f\"IncrementalPCA (Shuffled i.i.d)| Recon MSE = {mse_shf:.5f} | Drift={100*(mse_shf/mse_ref - 1):+.2f}%\")\nprint(f\"IncrementalPCA (Ordered/Drift) | Recon MSE = {mse_ord:.5f} | Drift={100*(mse_ord/mse_ref - 1):+.2f}%\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== 1. Audit n_iter pada TruncatedSVD (Spektrum Heavy-Tailed, sigma_9/sigma_8=0.94) ===\nn_iter | Subspace Overlap | Max RelErr SV | Status Rekomendasi\n--------------------------------------------------------------------\n   0   |          0.81927 |       0.29933 | BURUK (basis meleset)\n   1   |          0.96993 |       0.03751 | CUKUP\n   2   |          0.99803 |       0.00572 | SIAP PRODUKSI\n   4   |          0.99998 |       0.00012 | SIAP PRODUKSI\n   7   |          1.00000 |       0.00000 | SIAP PRODUKSI\n\n=== 2. Jebakan Uncentered TruncatedSVD pada Data Ber-Offset Rata-Rata (+8.0) ===\n|cos(v1_TruncatedSVD, vektor_rata2_global)| = 1.0000  <-- PC1 tercuri oleh offset rata-rata!\n|cos(v1_PCA_Centered, vektor_rata2_global)| = 0.1120  <-- PC1 fokus ke varians sinyal sejati\n\n=== 3. Pitfall IncrementalPCA (batch_size=24): Ordered Stream vs Shuffled Stream ===\nFull PCA Reference             | Recon MSE = 0.15361\nIncrementalPCA (Shuffled i.i.d)| Recon MSE = 0.15492 | Drift=+0.85%\nIncrementalPCA (Ordered/Drift) | Recon MSE = 0.17854 | Drift=+16.22%",
          "actualOutput": "=== 1. Audit n_iter pada TruncatedSVD (Spektrum Heavy-Tailed, sigma_9/sigma_8=0.94) ===\nn_iter | Subspace Overlap | Max RelErr SV | Status Rekomendasi\n--------------------------------------------------------------------\n   0   |          0.81927 |       0.29933 | BURUK (basis meleset)\n   1   |          0.96993 |       0.03751 | CUKUP\n   2   |          0.99803 |       0.00572 | SIAP PRODUKSI\n   4   |          0.99998 |       0.00012 | SIAP PRODUKSI\n   7   |          1.00000 |       0.00000 | SIAP PRODUKSI\n\n=== 2. Jebakan Uncentered TruncatedSVD pada Data Ber-Offset Rata-Rata (+8.0) ===\n|cos(v1_TruncatedSVD, vektor_rata2_global)| = 1.0000  <-- PC1 tercuri oleh offset rata-rata!\n|cos(v1_PCA_Centered, vektor_rata2_global)| = 0.1120  <-- PC1 fokus ke varians sinyal sejati\n\n=== 3. Pitfall IncrementalPCA (batch_size=24): Ordered Stream vs Shuffled Stream ===\nFull PCA Reference             | Recon MSE = 0.15361\nIncrementalPCA (Shuffled i.i.d)| Recon MSE = 0.15492 | Drift=+0.85%\nIncrementalPCA (Ordered/Drift) | Recon MSE = 0.17854 | Drift=+16.22%",
          "explanation": "Mengukur pengaruh n_iter=0..7 pada keselarasan subruang matriks heavy-tailed, membuktikan pencurian PC1 oleh offset rata-rata global pada uncentered TruncatedSVD, dan mengukur drift galat rekonstruksi IncrementalPCA pada aliran kronologis tanpa shuffle.",
