          "code": "import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(1931)\n\n# Bangun matriks berbasis bagian (parts-based): 240 sampel x 20 fitur dari 4 blok lokal murni\nn, d, k = 240, 20, 4\nH_true = np.zeros((k, d))\nfor c in range(k):\n    H_true[c, c * 5 : (c + 1) * 5] = rng.uniform(0.7, 1.3, size=5)\nW_true = rng.exponential(scale=1.0, size=(n, k)) * (rng.uniform(0, 1, size=(n, k)) > 0.35)\nW_true = np.maximum(W_true, 0.05)\nX = np.maximum(W_true @ H_true + rng.uniform(0.0, 0.08, size=(n, d)), 1e-6)\n\ndef hoyer_sparsity(M: np.ndarray) -> float:\n    \"\"\"Metrik sparsity Hoyer in [0, 1]; 1 = super sparse, 0 = seragam rata.\"\"\"\n    vals = np.abs(M.ravel())\n    m = vals.size\n    l1 = float(np.sum(vals))\n    l2 = float(np.sqrt(np.sum(vals ** 2))) + 1e-12\n    return (np.sqrt(m) - (l1 / l2)) / (np.sqrt(m) - 1.0)\n\ndef nmf_mu_frobenius(X_mat: np.ndarray, k_rank: int, n_iter: int = 80, seed: int = 42):\n    r = np.random.default_rng(seed)\n    W = r.uniform(0.1, 1.0, size=(X_mat.shape[0], k_rank))\n    H = r.uniform(0.1, 1.0, size=(k_rank, X_mat.shape[1]))\n    eps = 1e-10\n    losses = []\n    for _ in range(n_iter):\n        # Aturan Multiplicative Update Lee & Seung (Frobenius / beta=2)\n        H *= (W.T @ X_mat) / (W.T @ W @ H + eps)\n        W *= (X_mat @ H.T) / (W @ H @ H.T + eps)\n        losses.append(0.5 * float(np.sum((X_mat - W @ H) ** 2)))\n    return W, H, losses\n\ndef nmf_mu_kl(X_mat: np.ndarray, k_rank: int, n_iter: int = 80, seed: int = 42):\n    r = np.random.default_rng(seed)\n    W = r.uniform(0.1, 1.0, size=(X_mat.shape[0], k_rank))\n    H = r.uniform(0.1, 1.0, size=(k_rank, X_mat.shape[1]))\n    eps = 1e-10\n    ones = np.ones_like(X_mat)\n    losses = []\n    for _ in range(n_iter):\n        # Aturan Multiplicative Update Lee & Seung (Generalized KL / beta=1)\n        WH = W @ H + eps\n        H *= (W.T @ (X_mat / WH)) / (W.T @ ones + eps)\n        WH = W @ H + eps\n        W *= ((X_mat / WH) @ H.T) / (ones @ H.T + eps)\n        WH = np.maximum(W @ H, eps)\n        kl = float(np.sum(X_mat * np.log((X_mat + eps) / WH) - X_mat + WH))\n        losses.append(kl)\n    return W, H, losses\n\nW_f, H_f, loss_f = nmf_mu_frobenius(X, k_rank=k, n_iter=80, seed=42)\nW_k, H_k, loss_k = nmf_mu_kl(X, k_rank=k, n_iter=80, seed=42)\n\n# Bandingkan terhadap basis PCA (SVD)\nXc = X - X.mean(axis=0, keepdims=True)\n_, _, Vt_pca = np.linalg.svd(Xc, full_matrices=False)\nH_pca = Vt_pca[:k]\n\nmono_f = int(np.sum(np.diff(loss_f) > 1e-9))\nmono_k = int(np.sum(np.diff(loss_k) > 1e-9))\n\nprint(\"=== 1. Verifikasi Konvergensi Monoton Multiplicative Updates (Lee & Seung) ===\")\nprint(f\"Frobenius (beta=2) | Loss Iter-1={loss_f[0]:9.2f} -> Iter-80={loss_f[-1]:8.4f} | Pelanggaran Monoton={mono_f}\")\nprint(f\"Gen. KL   (beta=1) | Loss Iter-1={loss_k[0]:9.2f} -> Iter-80={loss_k[-1]:8.4f} | Pelanggaran Monoton={mono_k}\")\n\nprint(\"\\n=== 2. Parts-Based Interpretability: PCA (Holistik Negatif) vs NMF (Aditif Sparse) ===\")\nfor label, H_mat in [\n    (\"PCA Basis (V_k^T)\", H_pca),\n    (\"NMF Frobenius (H)\", H_f),\n    (\"NMF Gen. KL   (H)\", H_k),\n]:\n    neg_pct = 100.0 * float(np.mean(H_mat < -1e-6))\n    sp = hoyer_sparsity(H_mat)\n    # Normalisasi baris agar mudah ukur dominasi blok lokal\n    Hn = H_mat / (np.max(np.abs(H_mat), axis=1, keepdims=True) + 1e-12)\n    near_zero_pct = 100.0 * float(np.mean(np.abs(Hn) < 0.05))\n    print(f\"  {label:18s} | Entri Negatif={neg_pct:5.1f}% | Near-Zero (<5%)={near_zero_pct:5.1f}% | Hoyer Sparsity={sp:.4f}\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== 1. Verifikasi Konvergensi Monoton Multiplicative Updates (Lee & Seung) ===\nFrobenius (beta=2) | Loss Iter-1=  1644.23 -> Iter-80=  1.3695 | Pelanggaran Monoton=0\nGen. KL   (beta=1) | Loss Iter-1=  1563.78 -> Iter-80= 11.8928 | Pelanggaran Monoton=0\n\n=== 2. Parts-Based Interpretability: PCA (Holistik Negatif) vs NMF (Aditif Sparse) ===\n  PCA Basis (V_k^T)  | Entri Negatif= 37.5% | Near-Zero (<5%)= 21.2% | Hoyer Sparsity=0.3350\n  NMF Frobenius (H)  | Entri Negatif=  0.0% | Near-Zero (<5%)= 75.0% | Hoyer Sparsity=0.5370\n  NMF Gen. KL   (H)  | Entri Negatif=  0.0% | Near-Zero (<5%)= 70.0% | Hoyer Sparsity=0.5411",
