          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.decomposition import FactorAnalysis, FastICA, PCA\nfrom sklearn.metrics import r2_score\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(1942)\n\n# 1) Factor Analysis vs PCA pada Noise Unik Heteroskedastik per Sensor\n#    10 sensor mengukur 2 faktor proses industri laten; sensor 7,8,9 sangat bising (sigma=3.5..4.5)!\nn_s = 900\nZ_lat = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(n_s, 2))\nW_true = np.array([\n    [1.1, 0.1], [1.0, -0.2], [0.9, 0.3], [0.8, 0.2],\n    [0.1, 1.1], [-0.2, 1.0], [0.2, 0.9],\n    [0.3, 0.2], [0.2, -0.3], [-0.2, 0.2],\n])\nnoise_stds = np.array([0.35, 0.35, 0.40, 0.40, 0.35, 0.35, 0.40, 3.5, 4.0, 4.5])\nX_sensors = Z_lat @ W_true.T + rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(n_s, 10)) * noise_stds[None, :]\n\npca_2 = PCA(n_components=2).fit(X_sensors)\n# Tips Produksi: inisialisasi noise_variance_init proporsional varians fitur mencegah EM terjebak di sensor bervarians raksasa!\nfa_2 = FactorAnalysis(\n    n_components=2,\n    svd_method=\"lapack\",\n    max_iter=1000,\n    tol=1e-4,\n    noise_variance_init=np.var(X_sensors, axis=0) * 0.5,\n    random_state=42,\n).fit(X_sensors)\n\nZ_pca = pca_2.transform(X_sensors)\nZ_fa = fa_2.transform(X_sensors)\n\n# Ukur seberapa baik 2 komponen terekstrak memprediksi kedua faktor laten sejati (R^2 linear projection)\ndef latent_r2(Z_est: np.ndarray, Z_gt: np.ndarray) -> float:\n    B = np.linalg.lstsq(Z_est, Z_gt, rcond=None)[0]\n    return float(r2_score(Z_gt, Z_est @ B))\n\nprint(\"=== 1. Heteroscedastic Sensor Noise: PCA (Isotropik) vs Factor Analysis (Psi Diagonal) ===\")\nprint(f\"Pemulihan 2 Faktor Laten Sejati (R^2) | PCA={latent_r2(Z_pca, Z_lat):.4f} vs FactorAnalysis={latent_r2(Z_fa, Z_lat):.4f}\")\nprint(f\"True Noise Var Psi (sensor 0..2 vs 7..9) : {[round(float(x**2), 2) for x in noise_stds[:3]]} vs {[round(float(x**2), 2) for x in noise_stds[7:]]}\")\nprint(f\"Est. FA Noise Var  (sensor 0..2 vs 7..9) : {[round(float(x), 2) for x in fa_2.noise_variance_[:3]]} vs {[round(float(x), 2) for x in fa_2.noise_variance_[7:]]}\")\n\n# 2) Identifiabilitas FastICA: Sumber Non-Gaussian (Laplace + Uniform) vs Sumber Gaussian Kembar\ns_lap = rng.laplace(0.0, 1.0 / np.sqrt(2.0), size=1000)\ns_uni = rng.uniform(-np.sqrt(3.0), np.sqrt(3.0), size=1000)\nS_ng = np.column_stack([s_lap, s_uni])\n\nS_gauss = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(1000, 2))\nA_2 = np.array([[1.0, 0.85], [0.65, -0.95]])\n\nica_ng = FastICA(n_components=2, whiten=\"unit-variance\", random_state=42).fit_transform(S_ng @ A_2.T)\nica_ga = FastICA(n_components=2, whiten=\"unit-variance\", random_state=42).fit_transform(S_gauss @ A_2.T)\n\ndef best_match_2d(S_est: np.ndarray, S_gt: np.ndarray) -> tuple[float, float]:\n    C = np.abs(np.corrcoef(S_gt.T, S_est.T)[:2, 2:])\n    p1 = (C[0, 0] + C[1, 1]) / 2.0\n    p2 = (C[0, 1] + C[1, 0]) / 2.0\n    if p1 >= p2:\n        return round(float(C[0, 0]), 4), round(float(C[1, 1]), 4)\n    return round(float(C[0, 1]), 4), round(float(C[1, 0]), 4)\n\nprint(\"\\n=== 2. Batas Identifiabilitas FastICA (Non-Gaussian vs Gaussian Murni) ===\")\nprint(f\"Sumber Non-Gaussian (Laplace + Uniform) | Best |Corr| = {best_match_2d(ica_ng, S_ng)}  <-- Teridentifikasi!\")\nprint(f\"Sumber Gaussian Kembar (N(0,1) + N(0,1))| Best |Corr| = {best_match_2d(ica_ga, S_gauss)}  <-- Rotasi acak tak teridentifikasi!\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== 1. Heteroscedastic Sensor Noise: PCA (Isotropik) vs Factor Analysis (Psi Diagonal) ===\nPemulihan 2 Faktor Laten Sejati (R^2) | PCA=0.0039 vs FactorAnalysis=0.9609\nTrue Noise Var Psi (sensor 0..2 vs 7..9) : [0.12, 0.12, 0.16] vs [12.25, 16.0, 20.25]\nEst. FA Noise Var  (sensor 0..2 vs 7..9) : [0.11, 0.14, 0.15] vs [12.17, 15.76, 20.57]\n\n=== 2. Batas Identifiabilitas FastICA (Non-Gaussian vs Gaussian Murni) ===\nSumber Non-Gaussian (Laplace + Uniform) | Best |Corr| = (1.0, 0.9995)  <-- Teridentifikasi!\nSumber Gaussian Kembar (N(0,1) + N(0,1))| Best |Corr| = (0.7657, 0.7613)  <-- Rotasi acak tak teridentifikasi!",
