          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.decomposition import FastICA, PCA\nfrom sklearn.linear_model import Ridge\nfrom sklearn.metrics import root_mean_squared_error\nfrom sklearn.model_selection import GridSearchCV, KFold, train_test_split\nfrom sklearn.pipeline import Pipeline\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(1943)\n\n# 1) Bencana Aturan Kaku \"Selalu Ambil 95% Varians\" pada Matriks High-Noise (d ~ 0.45 n)\nn_tot, d, k_true = 480, 160, 4\nF_true = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(n_tot, k_true))\nB_load = rng.normal(0.0, 0.24, size=(d, k_true))\nB_load *= np.array([1.45, 1.25, 1.10, 0.95])[None, :]\nX = F_true @ B_load.T + rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(n_tot, d))\ny = 2.5 * F_true[:, 0] - 1.9 * F_true[:, 1] + 1.5 * F_true[:, 2] - 1.2 * F_true[:, 3] + rng.normal(0.0, 0.7, size=n_tot)\n\nX_tr, X_te, y_tr, y_te = train_test_split(X, y, test_size=0.25, random_state=42)\nn_tr = X_tr.shape[0]\ngamma = d / n_tr\n\n# Strategi A (Anti-Pattern): PCA(n_components=0.95)\npipe_95 = Pipeline([(\"sc\", StandardScaler()), (\"pca\", PCA(n_components=0.95)), (\"rg\", Ridge(alpha=1.0))]).fit(X_tr, y_tr)\nk_95 = int(pipe_95.named_steps[\"pca\"].n_components_)\nrmse_95 = float(root_mean_squared_error(y_te, pipe_95.predict(X_te)))\n\n# Strategi B (Marchenko-Pastur Cutoff): estimasi sigma^2 dari median bulk eigen (skala korelasi)\nX_tr_s = StandardScaler().fit_transform(X_tr)\neigs_tr = np.linalg.eigvalsh(np.cov(X_tr_s, rowvar=False))[::-1]\n# Estimasi noise variance bulk: median eigenvalue / median teoritis MP (~1 - gamma/3 untuk gamma < 0.6)\n# Atau eksak pada fitur terstandardisasi: total trace = d, rata-rata noise di luar top spike <= 1.0\nlam_plus_std = 1.0 * (1.0 + np.sqrt(gamma)) ** 2\nk_mp = int(np.sum(eigs_tr > lam_plus_std))\npipe_mp = Pipeline([(\"sc\", StandardScaler()), (\"pca\", PCA(n_components=k_mp)), (\"rg\", Ridge(alpha=1.0))]).fit(X_tr, y_tr)\nrmse_mp = float(root_mean_squared_error(y_te, pipe_mp.predict(X_te)))\n\n# Strategi C (Nested Downstream CV untuk memilih k)\ngs = GridSearchCV(\n    Pipeline([(\"sc\", StandardScaler()), (\"pca\", PCA()), (\"rg\", Ridge(alpha=1.0))]),\n    param_grid={\"pca__n_components\": [2, 4, 6, 12, 30, 80]},\n    cv=KFold(n_splits=5, shuffle=True, random_state=42),\n    scoring=\"neg_root_mean_squared_error\",\n).fit(X_tr, y_tr)\nk_cv = int(gs.best_params_[\"pca__n_components\"])\nrmse_cv = float(root_mean_squared_error(y_te, gs.predict(X_te)))\n\nprint(f\"=== 1. Pemilihan Rank k pada High-Noise Matrix (n_tr={n_tr}, d={d}, gamma={gamma:.3f}, k_true={k_true}) ===\")\nprint(f\"Batas Marchenko-Pastur lambda_+ = {lam_plus_std:.4f} | Top-6 Eigenvalues = {[round(float(x), 3) for x in eigs_tr[:6]]}\")\nprint(f\"Aturan Kaku PCA(0.95)       | k terpilih = {k_95:3d} (menelan {k_95 - k_true} komponen noise!) | Test RMSE = {rmse_95:.4f}\")\nprint(f\"Pemangkasan Marchenko-Pastur| k terpilih = {k_mp:3d} (tepat pada sinyal sejati!)    | Test RMSE = {rmse_mp:.4f}\")\nprint(f\"Downstream 5-Fold GridSearch| k terpilih = {k_cv:3d}                                | Test RMSE = {rmse_cv:.4f}\")\n\n# 2) Audit Ambiguitas Urutan & Tanda pada FastICA Antar Run Produksi (Seed 1 vs Seed 2)\nt_grid = np.linspace(0, 6, 500)\nS_demo = np.column_stack([np.sin(2.5 * t_grid), np.sign(np.sin(4.0 * t_grid)), rng.laplace(0, 1, 500)])\nX_demo = S_demo @ np.array([[1.0, 0.5, 0.3], [0.4, 1.1, -0.6], [-0.5, 0.4, 1.0]]).T\nica_r1 = FastICA(n_components=3, whiten=\"unit-variance\", random_state=1).fit_transform(X_demo)\nica_r2 = FastICA(n_components=3, whiten=\"unit-variance\", random_state=4).fit_transform(X_demo)\nC_runs = np.corrcoef(ica_r1.T, ica_r2.T)[:3, 3:]\n\nprint(\"\\n=== 2. Audit Stabilitas Indeks FastICA (Run Seed=1 vs Run Seed=4) ===\")\nprint(\"Matriks Korelasi (Baris=Seed1 IC0..2, Kolom=Seed4 IC0..2) -> Bertukar indeks & balik tanda!:\")\nfor i in range(3):\n    print(f\"  Seed1 IC{i} -> {[round(float(C_runs[i, j]), 3) for j in range(3)]}\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== 1. Pemilihan Rank k pada High-Noise Matrix (n_tr=360, d=160, gamma=0.444, k_true=4) ===\nBatas Marchenko-Pastur lambda_+ = 2.7778 | Top-6 Eigenvalues = [13.447, 11.945, 8.429, 5.94, 2.079, 1.995]\nAturan Kaku PCA(0.95)       | k terpilih = 122 (menelan 118 komponen noise!) | Test RMSE = 1.3736\nPemangkasan Marchenko-Pastur| k terpilih =   4 (tepat pada sinyal sejati!)    | Test RMSE = 1.2125\nDownstream 5-Fold GridSearch| k terpilih =   4                                | Test RMSE = 1.2125\n\n=== 2. Audit Stabilitas Indeks FastICA (Run Seed=1 vs Run Seed=4) ===\nMatriks Korelasi (Baris=Seed1 IC0..2, Kolom=Seed4 IC0..2) -> Bertukar indeks & balik tanda!:\n  Seed1 IC0 -> [0.0, 1.0, 0.001]\n  Seed1 IC1 -> [1.0, -0.0, 0.0]\n  Seed1 IC2 -> [0.0, 0.001, -1.0]",
          "actualOutput": "=== 1. Pemilihan Rank k pada High-Noise Matrix (n_tr=360, d=160, gamma=0.444, k_true=4) ===\nBatas Marchenko-Pastur lambda_+ = 2.7778 | Top-6 Eigenvalues = [13.447, 11.945, 8.429, 5.94, 2.079, 1.995]\nAturan Kaku PCA(0.95)       | k terpilih = 122 (menelan 118 komponen noise!) | Test RMSE = 1.3736\nPemangkasan Marchenko-Pastur| k terpilih =   4 (tepat pada sinyal sejati!)    | Test RMSE = 1.2125\nDownstream 5-Fold GridSearch| k terpilih =   4                                | Test RMSE = 1.2125\n\n=== 2. Audit Stabilitas Indeks FastICA (Run Seed=1 vs Run Seed=4) ===\nMatriks Korelasi (Baris=Seed1 IC0..2, Kolom=Seed4 IC0..2) -> Bertukar indeks & balik tanda!:\n  Seed1 IC0 -> [0.0, 1.0, 0.001]\n  Seed1 IC1 -> [1.0, -0.0, 0.0]\n  Seed1 IC2 -> [0.0, 0.001, -1.0]",
